{
  "name": "leptos-chartistry",
  "description": "A modular and extensible charting library for the Leptos web framework, designed to render performant SVG-based visualizations with minimal boilerplate. It features a reactive composition model for defining series types like line and bar charts, alongside highly customizable axis markers, legends, and interactive tooltips. The architecture supports both client-side WASM hydration and server-side rendering, leveraging a robust coordinate projection system and sophisticated color interpolation.",
